---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Projects - Emmanuel Gutiérrez Pizarro">

  <!-- ENGLISH -->
  <div class="lang-en">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="page-header">
        <h1>Projects</h1>
        <p>Available for collaborations on data, AI and territorial intelligence. Below: current services and the engagements I have led through JP Asesores and the ADC.</p>
      </div>

      <section class="services">
        <p class="section-tag">Services</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">What I'm available for</h2>
        <div class="project-list">
          <div class="project-item"><div class="project-year">Service</div><div class="project-info"><h3>Territorial Fiscal Diagnostic</h3><p>Quantifying the gap between what a territory generates and what it captures. Auditable methodology with cross-checking sources and an explicit deviation rate. <strong>Typical scope:</strong> 8-12 weeks · <strong>Deliverable:</strong> 80-150 page PDF report + executive presentation.</p><div class="project-tags"><span class="tag tag-fiscal">Fiscal</span><span class="tag tag-data">Data</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="project-item"><div class="project-year">Service</div><div class="project-info"><h3>Knowledge Graph for AI &amp; RAG</h3><p>Design and build of curated, domain-specific knowledge graphs with a graduated-truth protocol. The foundation that makes RAG and agentic AI actually work. <strong>Typical scope:</strong> custom, from 4 weeks (pilot) to multi-month · <strong>Deliverable:</strong> live graph + ontology documentation + integration guide.</p><div class="project-tags"><span class="tag tag-data">Data</span><span class="tag tag-model">AI</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="project-item"><div class="project-year">Service</div><div class="project-info"><h3>Community data systems &amp; census coordination</h3><p>End-to-end coordination of community-led data collection: design, field operations, analysis and dissemination. Adapted to district, municipal or organizational scale. <strong>Typical scope:</strong> 4-6 months · <strong>Deliverable:</strong> dataset + cartography + report + locality-level reports.</p><div class="project-tags"><span class="tag tag-data">Data</span><span class="tag tag-funds">Field</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="project-item"><div class="project-year">Service</div><div class="project-info"><h3>Strategic advisory</h3><p>On territorial intelligence, applied AI, knowledge engineering or fiscal sustainability. Working with leadership teams of municipalities, foundations, cooperatives or impact-driven ventures. <strong>Typical scope:</strong> half-day workshops to multi-week engagements · <strong>Deliverable:</strong> strategy memo + actionable roadmap.</p><div class="project-tags"><span class="tag tag-model">Advisory</span></div></div></div>
        </div>
        <p style="margin-top: 1rem; font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-secondary);">Engagement scope and pricing on request. Write to <a href="mailto:jgutierrez@jpasesorescr.com" style="color: var(--brand);">jgutierrez@jpasesorescr.com</a> with a brief context.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="dt-showcase" style="margin-top: 3rem;">
        <p class="section-tag">Delivered <span class="pub-badge pub-badge-done" style="margin-left:6px;">Live</span></p>
        <h2 class="section-title">Nosara 3D Digital Twin</h2>
        <p style="font-size:14px; color:var(--text-secondary); margin:-1.2rem 0 1.5rem; line-height:1.7; max-width:640px;">The first district-level 3D digital twin in Costa Rica: 400+ data layers, historical cartography from 1944 to today, self-updating climate and risk simulations. <a href="https://desarrollocomunitario.org/gemelodigital" class="btn btn-outline" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex; padding:5px 14px; font-size:12px; margin-left:6px; vertical-align:middle;">Visit live twin</a></p>
        <div class="dt-grid">
          <div class="dt-card"><video src="/video/neon_v1.mp4" autoplay muted loop playsinline></video><span class="dt-label">View 1</span></div>
          <div class="dt-card"><video src="/video/neon_v2.mp4" autoplay muted loop playsinline></video><span class="dt-label">View 2</span></div>
          <div class="dt-card"><video src="/video/neon_v3.mp4" autoplay muted loop playsinline></video><span class="dt-label">View 3</span></div>
          <div class="dt-card"><video src="/video/neon_v4.mp4" autoplay muted loop playsinline></video><span class="dt-label">View 4</span></div>
          <div class="dt-card"><video src="/video/neon_v5.mp4" autoplay muted loop playsinline></video><span class="dt-label">View 5</span></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="kg-showcase" style="margin-top: 3rem;">
        <p class="section-tag">Interactive</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">Territorial Knowledge Graph</h2>
        <p style="font-size:14px; color:var(--text-secondary); margin:-1.2rem 0 1.5rem; line-height:1.7; max-width:640px;">390+ nodes, 790+ semantic edges. Drag to rotate, scroll to zoom, click any node to explore.</p>
        <div class="kg-frame-wrap">
          <iframe src="/graph/" class="kg-frame" loading="lazy" title="Territorial Knowledge Graph"></iframe>
        </div>
        <p style="margin-top: .75rem;"><a href="/graph/" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline" style="font-size:12px;">Open full screen</a></p>
      </section>

      <section class="projects" style="margin-top: 3rem;">
        <p class="section-tag">Track record</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">What I have built</h2>
        <div class="project-list">
          <div class="project-item"><div class="project-year">2026 - now</div><div class="project-info"><h3>My Intelligent System</h3><p>My current practice: installing intelligent systems, automation and applied AI for businesses, organizations and institutions. A proprietary kernel, connected to APIs for what is complex or regulated, with monitoring on every dependency so maintenance arrives on its own. No monthly fee; closed price per stage.</p><div class="project-tags"><span class="tag tag-flagship">Flagship</span><span class="tag tag-systems">Systems &amp; AI</span></div><p style="margin-top: 8px;"><a href="https://myintelligentsystem.com" class="pub-action" target="_blank">Visit site ↗</a> &middot; <a href="https://myintelligentsystem.com/tour/" class="pub-action" target="_blank">Tour my 3D office ↗</a></p></div></div>
          <div class="project-item"><div class="project-year">2026</div><div class="project-info"><h3>Nosara 3D Digital Twin</h3><p>First district-level 3D digital twin in Costa Rica, and by some accounts the first in Central America. Integrates 400+ information layers: relief, 8,000+ detected buildings, roads, rivers, the district's 56 localities, 2024 census data, water concessions, cadastre and 28-model climate projections. Layers historical cartography from 1944, 1973 and 1988 against current satellite imagery, and updates itself from public data services to simulate scenarios.</p><div class="project-tags"><span class="tag tag-delivered">Delivered</span><span class="tag tag-data">Data</span><span class="tag tag-fiscal">Territorial</span></div><p style="margin-top: 8px;"><a href="https://desarrollocomunitario.org/gemelodigital" class="pub-action" target="_blank">Visit site ↗</a></p></div></div>
          <div class="project-item"><div class="project-year">2026</div><div class="project-info"><h3>Business and Financial Plan, Asocove Dos Rios</h3><p>Business plan, financial plan, model and annexes for a rural community project. Replicable model in social and solidarity economy contexts.</p><div class="project-tags"><span class="tag tag-delivered">Delivered</span><span class="tag tag-model">Financial model</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="project-item"><div class="project-year">2024</div><div class="project-info"><h3>Nosara Community Census</h3><p>Coordination of the first district-level census in Costa Rica, with technical advisory from the National Institute of Statistics and Census (INEC). 95.1% household coverage. USD 120,000 raised plus USD 50,000 in-kind.</p><div class="project-tags"><span class="tag tag-delivered">Delivered</span><span class="tag tag-data">Data</span><span class="tag tag-fiscal">Fiscal</span><span class="tag tag-funds">Funds</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="project-item"><div class="project-year">2026</div><div class="project-info"><h3>Nosara District Territorial Fiscal Balance</h3><p>First district-level fiscal study in Costa Rica. Fiscal gap quantified (above USD 55M per year), cadastral gap factor (12.1x), 96.6% informal lodging identified. Estimated district GDP: USD 2.13 billion.</p><div class="project-tags"><span class="tag tag-delivered">Delivered</span><span class="tag tag-fiscal">Fiscal</span><span class="tag tag-data">Data</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="project-item"><div class="project-year">2026</div><div class="project-info"><h3>Operating Systems for Territorial Intelligence</h3><p>Territorial intelligence framework integrating fiscal analysis, census data and participatory governance. Includes the Mapa de Voces de Nosara (weighted-distribution governance model with four representation sectors), SIG cartography (7 layers, 1,536 features) and 30 locality-level reports. First field deployment: the district of Nosara.</p><div class="project-tags"><span class="tag tag-data">Data</span><span class="tag tag-fiscal">Fiscal</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="project-item"><div class="project-year">2024 - now</div><div class="project-info"><h3>Territorial Knowledge Graph</h3><p>Operational knowledge graph with 390+ typed nodes, 790+ semantic edges across 8 semantic relation types, 768-dimensional vector embeddings and a graduated-truth protocol (1 source = signal, 2 = hypothesis, 3+ = operational fact). Built as auditable foundation for RAG pipelines and agentic workflows in territorial analysis. Live deployment with daily curation.</p><div class="project-tags"><span class="tag tag-data">Data</span><span class="tag tag-model">AI</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="project-item"><div class="project-year">2013 - 2026</div><div class="project-info"><h3>Entrepreneurship, innovation and early-stage support</h3><p>13 years of experience in entrepreneurship, innovation and early-stage venture support across rural communities, credit programs, market access and business development. Program Coordinator at Yo Emprendedor 2013-2020, independent advisory 2020-present.</p><div class="project-tags"><span class="tag tag-delivered">Delivered</span><span class="tag tag-model">Early-stage</span></div></div></div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ESPANOL -->
  <div class="lang-es">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="page-header">
        <h1>Proyectos</h1>
        <p>Disponible para colaboraciones en datos, IA e inteligencia territorial. A continuación: servicios actuales y los proyectos que he liderado desde JP Asesores y la ADC.</p>
      </div>

      <section class="services">
        <p class="section-tag">Servicios</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">Para lo que estoy disponible</h2>
        <div class="project-list">
          <div class="project-item"><div class="project-year">Servicio</div><div class="project-info"><h3>Diagnóstico Fiscal Territorial</h3><p>Cuantificar la brecha entre lo que un territorio genera y lo que captura. Metodología auditable con fuentes cruzadas y tasa de desviación explícita. <strong>Alcance típico:</strong> 8-12 semanas · <strong>Entregable:</strong> informe PDF de 80-150 páginas + presentación ejecutiva.</p><div class="project-tags"><span class="tag tag-fiscal">Fiscal</span><span class="tag tag-data">Datos</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="project-item"><div class="project-year">Servicio</div><div class="project-info"><h3>Grafo de Conocimiento para IA y RAG</h3><p>Diseño y construcción de grafos de conocimiento curados, específicos por dominio, con protocolo de verdad graduada. La base que hace que RAG y la IA agéntica realmente funcionen. <strong>Alcance típico:</strong> custom, desde 4 semanas (piloto) hasta multi-mes · <strong>Entregable:</strong> grafo activo + documentación de ontología + guía de integración.</p><div class="project-tags"><span class="tag tag-data">Datos</span><span class="tag tag-model">IA</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="project-item"><div class="project-year">Servicio</div><div class="project-info"><h3>Sistemas de datos comunitarios y coordinación de censos</h3><p>Coordinación integral de la recolección comunitaria de datos: diseño, operaciones de campo, análisis y difusión. Adaptable a escala distrital, municipal u organizacional. <strong>Alcance típico:</strong> 4-6 meses · <strong>Entregable:</strong> dataset + cartografía + informe + reportes por localidad.</p><div class="project-tags"><span class="tag tag-data">Datos</span><span class="tag tag-funds">Campo</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="project-item"><div class="project-year">Servicio</div><div class="project-info"><h3>Asesoría estratégica</h3><p>Sobre inteligencia territorial, IA aplicada, ingeniería del conocimiento o sostenibilidad fiscal. Colaboro con equipos de liderazgo de municipalidades, fundaciones, cooperativas o emprendimientos con propósito. <strong>Alcance típico:</strong> talleres de medio día a engagements de varias semanas · <strong>Entregable:</strong> memo estratégico + hoja de ruta accionable.</p><div class="project-tags"><span class="tag tag-model">Asesoría</span></div></div></div>
        </div>
        <p style="margin-top: 1rem; font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-secondary);">Alcance y precio a solicitud. Escribir a <a href="mailto:jgutierrez@jpasesorescr.com" style="color: var(--brand);">jgutierrez@jpasesorescr.com</a> con un breve contexto.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="dt-showcase" style="margin-top: 3rem;">
        <p class="section-tag">Entregado <span class="pub-badge pub-badge-done" style="margin-left:6px;">En línea</span></p>
        <h2 class="section-title">Gemelo Digital 3D de Nosara</h2>
        <p style="font-size:14px; color:var(--text-secondary); margin:-1.2rem 0 1.5rem; line-height:1.7; max-width:640px;">El primer gemelo digital 3D a nivel de distrito en Costa Rica: más de 400 capas de datos, cartografía histórica desde 1944 hasta hoy, simulaciones climáticas y de riesgo que se actualizan solas. <a href="https://desarrollocomunitario.org/gemelodigital" class="btn btn-outline" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex; padding:5px 14px; font-size:12px; margin-left:6px; vertical-align:middle;">Ver gemelo en vivo</a></p>
        <div class="dt-grid">
          <div class="dt-card"><video src="/video/neon_v1.mp4" autoplay muted loop playsinline></video><span class="dt-label">Vista 1</span></div>
          <div class="dt-card"><video src="/video/neon_v2.mp4" autoplay muted loop playsinline></video><span class="dt-label">Vista 2</span></div>
          <div class="dt-card"><video src="/video/neon_v3.mp4" autoplay muted loop playsinline></video><span class="dt-label">Vista 3</span></div>
          <div class="dt-card"><video src="/video/neon_v4.mp4" autoplay muted loop playsinline></video><span class="dt-label">Vista 4</span></div>
          <div class="dt-card"><video src="/video/neon_v5.mp4" autoplay muted loop playsinline></video><span class="dt-label">Vista 5</span></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="kg-showcase" style="margin-top: 3rem;">
        <p class="section-tag">Interactivo</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">Grafo de Conocimiento Territorial</h2>
        <p style="font-size:14px; color:var(--text-secondary); margin:-1.2rem 0 1.5rem; line-height:1.7; max-width:640px;">390+ nodos, 790+ aristas semánticas. Arrastra para rotar, scroll para zoom, click en cualquier nodo para explorar.</p>
        <div class="kg-frame-wrap">
          <iframe src="/graph/" class="kg-frame" loading="lazy" title="Grafo de Conocimiento Territorial"></iframe>
        </div>
        <p style="margin-top: .75rem;"><a href="/graph/" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline" style="font-size:12px;">Abrir pantalla completa</a></p>
      </section>

      <section class="projects" style="margin-top: 3rem;">
        <p class="section-tag">Recorrido</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">Lo que he construido</h2>
        <div class="project-list">
          <div class="project-item"><div class="project-year">2026 - hoy</div><div class="project-info"><h3>My Intelligent System</h3><p>Mi práctica actual: instalación de sistemas inteligentes, automatización e IA aplicada para negocios, organizaciones e instituciones. Un kernel propio, conectado a APIs para lo complejo o regulado, con vigía sobre cada dependencia para que el mantenimiento llegue solo. Sin cuota mensual; precio cerrado por etapa.</p><div class="project-tags"><span class="tag tag-flagship">Insignia</span><span class="tag tag-systems">Sistemas e IA</span></div><p style="margin-top: 8px;"><a href="https://myintelligentsystem.com" class="pub-action" target="_blank">Visitar sitio ↗</a> &middot; <a href="https://myintelligentsystem.com/tour/" class="pub-action" target="_blank">Recorra mi oficina en 3D ↗</a></p></div></div>
          <div class="project-item"><div class="project-year">2026</div><div class="project-info"><h3>Gemelo Digital 3D de Nosara</h3><p>El primer gemelo digital 3D a nivel de distrito en Costa Rica, y según algunos registros el primero de Centroamérica. Integra más de 400 capas de información: relieve, más de 8,000 edificios detectados, vías, ríos, las 56 localidades del distrito, datos del censo 2024, concesiones de agua, catastro y proyecciones climáticas con 28 modelos. Superpone cartografía histórica de 1944, 1973 y 1988 sobre la imagen satelital actual, y se actualiza solo desde servicios públicos de datos para simular escenarios.</p><div class="project-tags"><span class="tag tag-delivered">Entregado</span><span class="tag tag-data">Datos</span><span class="tag tag-fiscal">Territorial</span></div><p style="margin-top: 8px;"><a href="https://desarrollocomunitario.org/gemelodigital" class="pub-action" target="_blank">Visitar sitio ↗</a></p></div></div>
          <div class="project-item"><div class="project-year">2026</div><div class="project-info"><h3>Plan de Negocios y Plan Financiero, Asocove Dos Rios</h3><p>Elaboracion de plan de negocios, plan financiero, modelo y anexos para proyecto rural comunitario. Modelo replicable en contextos de economía social y solidaria.</p><div class="project-tags"><span class="tag tag-delivered">Entregado</span><span class="tag tag-model">Modelo financiero</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="project-item"><div class="project-year">2024</div><div class="project-info"><h3>Censo Comunitario de Nosara</h3><p>Coordinacion del primer censo a nivel de distrito en Costa Rica, con asesoría técnica del Instituto Nacional de Estadística y Censos (INEC). Cobertura del 95.1% de hogares. USD 120,000 en fondos gestionados y USD 50,000 en aportes en especie.</p><div class="project-tags"><span class="tag tag-delivered">Entregado</span><span class="tag tag-data">Datos</span><span class="tag tag-fiscal">Fiscal</span><span class="tag tag-funds">Fondos</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="project-item"><div class="project-year">2026</div><div class="project-info"><h3>Balance Fiscal Territorial del Distrito de Nosara</h3><p>Primer estudio fiscal a nivel de distrito en Costa Rica. Cuantificación de la brecha fiscal (superior a USD 55M anuales), cálculo del factor de brecha catastral (12.1x), identificación de 96.6% de alojamientos informales. PIB estimado del distrito: USD 2.13 mil millones.</p><div class="project-tags"><span class="tag tag-delivered">Entregado</span><span class="tag tag-fiscal">Fiscal</span><span class="tag tag-data">Datos</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="project-item"><div class="project-year">2026</div><div class="project-info"><h3>Sistemas Operativos para Inteligencia Territorial</h3><p>Framework de inteligencia territorial que integra análisis fiscal, datos censales y gobernanza participativa. Incluye el Mapa de Voces de Nosara (modelo de distribución ponderada con cuatro sectores de representación), cartografía SIG (7 capas, 1,536 features) y 30 reportes a nivel de localidad. Primer despliegue en campo: el distrito de Nosara.</p><div class="project-tags"><span class="tag tag-data">Datos</span><span class="tag tag-fiscal">Fiscal</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="project-item"><div class="project-year">2024 - hoy</div><div class="project-info"><h3>Grafo de Conocimiento Territorial</h3><p>Grafo de conocimiento operacional con 390+ nodos tipados, 790+ aristas semánticas en 8 tipos de relación, embeddings vectoriales de 768 dimensiones y un protocolo de verdad graduada (1 fuente = señal, 2 = hipótesis, 3+ = hecho operativo). Construido como base auditable para pipelines RAG y flujos agénticos en análisis territorial. Despliegue activo con curaduría diaria.</p><div class="project-tags"><span class="tag tag-data">Datos</span><span class="tag tag-model">IA</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="project-item"><div class="project-year">2013 - 2026</div><div class="project-info"><h3>Emprendimiento, innovación y apoyo a proyectos en fase temprana</h3><p>13 años de experiencia en emprendimiento, innovación y apoyo a proyectos en fase temprana en comunidades rurales, programas de crédito, acceso a mercados y desarrollo empresarial. Coordinador de Programas en Yo Emprendedor 2013-2020, asesoría independiente 2020-presente.</p><div class="project-tags"><span class="tag tag-delivered">Entregado</span><span class="tag tag-model">Fase temprana</span></div></div></div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>

</Layout>
